---
import InteriorLayout from "../../../layouts/InteriorLayout.astro";
---

<InteriorLayout
  title="Meet the Doctor: Dr. Glenn Ashworth | Eastland Family Dental"
  description="Meet Dr. Glenn Ashworth, dentist at Eastland Family Dental in Independence, MO."
  path="/our-practice/meet-the-doctor/"
  eyebrow="Meet the doctor"
  heading="Dr. Glenn Ashworth"
  intro="A general dentist in Independence, MO, Air Force veteran, and father of six who values practical education and comfortable, family-focused care."
>
  <section class="px-4 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.82fr_1.18fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-20">
      <figure class="reveal reveal-left overflow-hidden rounded-4xl bg-air sm:rounded-6xl">
        <img src="/images/team/glenn-ashworth.webp" alt="Dr. Glenn Ashworth" width="500" height="500" class="aspect-square h-auto w-full object-cover" />
      </figure>

      <div class="reveal reveal-right">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.2em] text-eucalyptus uppercase">His path to dentistry</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-5xl">A Modern Approach To Family Dentistry</h2>
        <div class="mt-7 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-body">
          <p>Dr. Ashworth grew up in Battle Ground, Washington. He began his college studies in electrical engineering before choosing dentistry and completing his dental education in Buffalo, New York.</p>
          <p>While serving in the United States Air Force, he completed an Advanced Education in General Dentistry residency and an additional preceptorship. He later relocated to the Kansas City area with his wife.</p>
          <p>That mix of technical training and service informs the way he explains treatment: clearly, carefully, and with attention to the person behind the procedure.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-air px-4 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] lg:gap-20">
      <div class="reveal reveal-left">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.2em] text-blue uppercase">Beyond the office</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-5xl">Projects, Family Time &amp; The Great Outdoors</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal reveal-right border-t border-navy/15 pt-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-body">
        <p>Dr. Ashworth enjoys home-improvement projects, designing T-shirts, and building Lego projects with his children. He also spends time cycling, camping, hiking, skiing, and swimming.</p>
        <p class="mt-5">He and his wife have six children, making family life a meaningful part of the perspective he brings to caring for patients of different ages.</p>
        <a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-blue" href="/our-practice/meet-the-team/">Meet the full team <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InteriorLayout>
